{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820190/extras/World_of_Sipssassination-Small.png?t=1744413230\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As the centuries-long battle between the Sipssassins and the evil Drinkceptionists continues, a new band of Drinkceptionists have emerged from the shadows to drinkcept everyone\u2019s drinks and take over the world. You and the international league of Sipssassins must drink every drink to find these Drinkceptionists and save humanity from total drinkception.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820190/extras/Levels.gif?t=1744413230\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>CHOOSE YOUR MISSION</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pick between 5 unique missions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play in whatever order you want.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take on 1 of 4 distinct game modes:</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820190/extras/Statue.gif?t=1744413230\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>GAME MODE 1: SIPSTRACTION</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find and finish 6 drinks without getting caught.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Complete all drinks and receive a letter grade correlating to how many times you were detected or caught.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820190/extras/RunandGun.gif?t=1744413230\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>GAME MODE 2: HAPPY HOUR</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Drink as many drinks as you can within 2 minutes (or more...)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gain combos to up your score by drinking drinks in succession.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Keep your combo going past the 2 minute mark to enter into &quot;After Hours.&quot;</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820190/extras/Drinkvestigate.gif?t=1744413230\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>GAME MODE 3: DRINKVESTIGATE</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find and complete a drink to activate a special tracking ability. Once activated, locate the hidden Drinkceptionist and whack them with something. Take out all their hearts to win the round!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The faster you bring down the Drinkceptionist the better your score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820190/extras/FerrisWheel.gif?t=1744413230\" /></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>GAME MODE 4: EXPLORATION</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet zany characters and complete quests.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find hidden secrets and collectibles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get Legendary Drinks and Special Gadgets to give you power ups across all missions and game modes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>FEATURES</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">25 playable characters to unlock </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">5 unique missions with hidden secrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4 distinct game modes to prove your Sipssassin abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 60 different drinks to drink </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lots of NPCs to steal drinks from  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">6 Legendary Drinks that grant special power up abilities  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">6 Special Gadgets that help you be a sneaky little guy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">50 collectible shards to find and rebuild the Chalice of Destiny </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Disguises to gain access to restricted areas</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wacky characters to meet and talk to </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An alternate dimension video game conference called &quot;Yeet3&quot;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A super long straw so you can drink your neighbor's milkshake </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fun</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2820190?t=1744413230","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2820190?t=1744413230","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820190/8edc7b32f3504f0ef0d3e64a561f18515feef353/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744413230","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820190/8edc7b32f3504f0ef0d3e64a561f18515feef353/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744413230","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>Join the Discord</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820190/extras/Sip-JoinDiscordBanner-02.png?t=1744413230\" /></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820190/extras/World_of_Sipssassination-Small.png?t=1744413230\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As the centuries-long battle between the Sipssassins and the evil Drinkceptionists continues,